#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:5
#: 24ab3b2e80ae48e390c3740d0dcb6165
msgid "Wiki Editing - Submitting Changes"
msgstr "Wiki 编辑 - 提交变更"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:7
#: 35ae2d9d306e4db4b1d86d908c8c6e7b
msgid ""
"Once you have completed changes to the wiki on your local machine and tested"
" they are rendered correctly, follow the instructions below to submit a "
"PullRequest to have them included in the wiki.  This is the same :ref:`PR "
"process used for the flight code <dev:submitting-patches-back-to-master>`"
msgstr ""
"在本地计算机上完成 wiki 修改并测试渲染正确后，按照以下说明提交 Pull Request，将其纳入 wiki。流程与 :ref:`飞行代码的 PR"
" 流程 <dev:submitting-patches-back-to-master>` 相同"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:11
#: a7f8676efa824e13a13eefa44998cb75
msgid ""
"If you are not familiar with Git and GitHub please refer to the :ref:`Using "
"Git <dev:where-to-get-the-code>` pages to learn the basics."
msgstr ""
"如不熟悉 Git 和 GitHub，请参阅 :ref:`使用 Git <dev:where-to-get-the-code>` 页面了解基础知识。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:13
#: 14a50868173d46e2b0dcff0f53bc9e4b
msgid ""
"There are a number of way of using Git/Github - including a number of "
"different GUI and command line tools.  The typical process for working with "
"Git on the command line is:"
msgstr "使用 Git/GitHub 有多种方式——包括多种不同的 GUI 和命令行工具。命令行操作 Git 的典型流程如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:15
#: 2ae67e467cc0414191cc8c5cdfb3b961
msgid ""
":ref:`Rebase <git-rebase>` your repo's master branch on the upstream "
"ardupilot_wiki repo's master branch:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Rebase <git-rebase>` 您仓库的 master 分支到上游 ardupilot_wiki 仓库的 master 分支："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:17
#: b12bb80e2fad463e9158d4c6be548c1d
msgid ""
"The very first time a \"remote\" pointing back to the upstream "
"ardupilot_wiki repository must be created"
msgstr "第一次必须创建指向上游 ardupilot_wiki 仓库的「remote」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:23
#: 84302ba94a3a41ad9254ce34762730d2
msgid "Switch to your repo's master branch"
msgstr "切换到您仓库的 master 分支"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:31
#: 96366f82df0043bdbf9de7ddfe394832
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If the above command fails because of changes made to some files, "
"temporarily \"stash\" the changes by typing ``git stash save my-changes`` "
"and then later re-applied the changes by typing ``git stash apply "
"stash@{0}``"
msgstr ""
"如上述命令因某些文件的修改而失败，可使用 ``git stash save my-changes`` 临时「暂存」修改，稍后再用 ``git stash"
" apply stash@{0}`` 恢复"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:33
#: e396deb0e99740d5bbd3deb8a2bbe1c7
msgid "Pull in the changes from upstream/master to your master branch"
msgstr "将上游/master 的变更拉取到您的 master 分支"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:40
#: f38fefeb3bd64e08aa60631fd4b4e991
msgid ""
"Be sure to repeat these first steps if you make new changes in the future, "
"to assure that your local repo is up to date"
msgstr "未来再次进行修改时，务必重复这些初始步骤，确保本地仓库是最新的"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:43
#: ae3cd47ad80345cf832b8659a37fc009
msgid "Create a branch in your local clone for your changes"
msgstr "在本地 Clone 中为您的修改创建分支"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:49
#: e4e647f7f1ef4388920f7030df90a8a3
msgid "Make any changes needed and test them locally"
msgstr "进行所需的修改并在本地测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:51
#: 69653474e77e489aa06dc8851b6942e0
msgid "Add (aka \"Stage\") and Commit your changes:"
msgstr "添加（即「暂存」）并提交您的修改："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:58
#: 1520cf1d462f48ba9077c872f9d683b7
msgid ""
"\"Squash\" your commmits. See :ref:`git-interactive-rebase`. There should be"
" onlt one commit for changes related to a given topical change, even if "
"multiple pages wuth changes are involved."
msgstr ""
"「Squash」您的提交。参见 :ref:`git-interactive-"
"rebase`。即使涉及多个页面的修改，与特定主题相关的变更也应只有一个提交。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:60
#: 4fc983f77cb3461596d0d7c07d029bcf
msgid "Push your commits to your fork on GitHub"
msgstr "将您的提交推送到 GitHub 上的 Fork"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:66
#: b30a46b7cb534e3a93249c2e1a22bf77
msgid ""
"Open your clone's repository on the GitHub web page and `Create a pull "
"request on GitHub <https://help.github.com/articles/about-pull-"
"requests/>`__. You'll be making a pull request from your fork/branch on "
"GitHub to the    ardupilot_wiki/master repository. If using the GitHub for "
"Windows client, one convenient way to navigate to the repository/branch is "
"to click one of your commits and click the \"github\" (view this commit on "
"github.com) button:"
msgstr ""
"在 GitHub 网页上打开您 Clone 的仓库，`在 GitHub 上创建 Pull Request "
"<https://help.github.com/articles/about-pull-requests/>`__。您将从 GitHub 上的 "
"Fork/分支向 ardupilot_wiki/master 仓库发起 Pull Request。如使用 GitHub for Windows "
"客户端，导航到仓库/分支的便捷方式是点击某个提交，再点击「github」（在 github.com 上查看此提交）按钮："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:71
#: 4cd63585c424484db7757ec59acd3131
msgid ""
"On top of the web page select the \"Pull Request\" tab page, and then select"
" the green \"New pull request\" button:"
msgstr "在网页顶部选择「Pull Request」标签页，然后点击绿色「New pull request」按钮："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:76
#: 5174141eb23645b1aea8f6c61520821e
msgid ""
"The comparison should be between ardupilot_wiki:master and the new branch "
"you created. The website probably has defaulted to your clone's master "
"branch so click the \"compare\" combo box and change it to the correct "
"branch:"
msgstr ""
"比较应在 ardupilot_wiki:master 和您新建的分支之间进行。网站可能默认选中了您 Clone 的 master "
"分支，点击「compare」下拉框将其改为正确的分支："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:81
#: fe169c788c4d4eb089952cba95c0a935
msgid ""
"Check the list of change at the bottom of the page only includes your "
"intended changes, then press \"Create pull request\"."
msgstr "检查页面底部的变更列表是否仅包含您预期的修改，然后点击「Create pull request」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:86
#: ded5e499154c434a94bdca87aa28de61
msgid "How to get changes approved"
msgstr "如何获得变更批准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-submitting-changes.rst:88
#: 2bc491f24d8944878102c1791828829a
msgid ""
"All changes to the wiki are `reviewed "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/pulls>`__ by the wiki "
"\"maintainers\" to help reduce the chance of misleading or incorrect "
"information being posted.  Feel free to post comments in the PullRequest "
"and/or attend the :ref:`weekly dev meeting <dev:ardupilot-discord-server>` "
"to escalate getting your changes submitted."
msgstr ""
"所有 wiki 变更均由 wiki「维护者」 `审查 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/pulls>`__，以减少错误或误导性信息的发布。欢迎在 "
"Pull Request 中发表评论，也可参加 :ref:`每周开发者会议 <dev:ardupilot-discord-server>` "
"以推进您的变更提交。"
